1. Test the hardened extension against several live PRs.
2. Test IDE-like file tabs on large PRs and tune placement if GitHub changes sticky header behavior.
3. Add direct protocol opening for Cursor and VS Code behind a setting.
4. Add automated browser coverage only if live QA finds repeated regressions.
